message: "If you use NAAIL OpenLab™ in research, education, benchmarking, or Digital Twin studies, please cite this software."
title: "NAAIL OpenLab: An Evidence-Governed AI Platform for Business-School Education, Audit Digital Twins, and Reproducible Scientific Discovery"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Homayoun"
    given-names: "Saeid"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2536-0446"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-14"
