url: "https://github.com/Saehon/Saeid-Homayoun/tree/main/NAAIL-OpenLab"
abstract: >-
  NAAIL OpenLab is a research-first, human-led artificial intelligence platform for business-school education, audit simulation, and reproducible scientific discovery. It combines a Stable Knowledge Core and Replaceable Technology Core through an Adaptive Intelligence Fabric, with an Audit Digital Twin, governed multi-agent workflows, evidence provenance, FT50 and AJG-informed research intelligence, adversarial review, falsification, replication, and human approval. Auditing is the first deep implementation vertical, using fictional audit-firm archetypes and synthetic client cases for research and education.
